END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             18:00:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             0
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP              00:00:30
DRY_STEP              00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         00:00:02

INERTIAL_DAMPING     PARTIAL
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED  BOTH
